{
  "title": { "zh": "哪一位翻了", "en": "Which bit flipped" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "线上从第一拍起接连送来数据块：每块 4 位数据，后面跟 3 位校验码（生成式 1011）；线在每块里最多翻一位。在每块最后一位到达的那一拍，输出这块的第几位翻了（最先到达的是第 1 位，到第 7 位），没有翻就输出 0。",
    "en": "Blocks come down the wire back to back from the first tick: 4 data bits each, followed by 3 check bits (generator 1011); the wire flips at most one bit in a block. On the tick each block's last bit arrives, output which of its bits flipped (1 for the first to arrive, up to 7), or 0 if none did."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "到目前为止，校验码只用来判断收到的东西是好是坏。这一次每块只有 4 位数据，却带着 3 位校验码。",
        "en": "So far the check bits have only judged whether something arrived intact. This time each block carries just 4 data bits, and 3 check bits."
      }
    }
  ],
  "wires": { "in": [{ "name": "line", "label": { "zh": "进线", "en": "Wire in" } }] },
  "outputs": [{ "name": "pos", "label": { "zh": "翻了的位", "en": "Flipped bit" } }],
  "tests": [
    {
      "ticks": 14,
      "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [5, 12], "format": "blocks" }] } },
      "expect": { "pos": [null, null, null, null, null, null, 0, null, null, null, null, null, null, 0] }
    },
    {
      "ticks": 7,
      "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [9], "format": "blocks" }], "flips": [0] } },
      "expect": { "pos": [null, null, null, null, null, null, 1] }
    },
    {
      "ticks": 21,
      "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [3, 10, 6], "format": "blocks" }], "flips": [5, 9] } },
      "expect": {
        "pos": [
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          6,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          3,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          0
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "hidden": [
    {
      "ticks": 28,
      "wires": {
        "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [15, 0, 7, 8], "format": "blocks" }], "flips": [3, 8, 18, 26] }
      },
      "expect": {
        "pos": [
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          4,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          2,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          5,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          6
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "ticks": 7,
      "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [0], "format": "blocks" }], "flips": [6] } },
      "expect": { "pos": [null, null, null, null, null, null, 7] }
    },
    {
      "ticks": 14,
      "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [1, 2], "format": "blocks" }], "flips": [1, 11] } },
      "expect": { "pos": [null, null, null, null, null, null, 2, null, null, null, null, null, null, 5] }
    }
  ],
  "want": { "pos": "given" },
  "solution": [
    "z = const[value=0]()",
    "one = const[value=1]()",
    "three = const[value=3]()",
    "four = const[value=4]()",
    "five = const[value=5]()",
    "six = const[value=6]()",
    "seven = const[value=7]()",
    "g = reg[reg=A, start=0]()",
    "c = counter(g, z)",
    "e6 = equal(c, six)",
    "kg = keep[reg=A](e6)",
    "k = crc(line, g, z)",
    "q4 = equal(k, four)",
    "q1 = equal(k, one)",
    "q5 = equal(k, five)",
    "q7 = equal(k, seven)",
    "q3 = equal(k, three)",
    "s1 = select(q4, one, k)",
    "s2 = select(q1, three, s1)",
    "s3 = select(q5, four, s2)",
    "s4 = select(q7, five, s3)",
    "s5 = select(q3, seven, s4)",
    "y = select(e6, s5)",
    "pos <- y"
  ],
  "naive": [
    "z = const[value=0]()",
    "six = const[value=6]()",
    "g = reg[reg=A, start=0]()",
    "c = counter(g, z)",
    "e6 = equal(c, six)",
    "kg = keep[reg=A](e6)",
    "k = crc(line, g, z)",
    "y = select(e6, k)",
    "pos <- y"
  ]
}
